      "name": "战绩入口",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "battle-navigation",
      "description": "金黄入口在海蓝顶栏中提供识别。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#battle\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 21h8m-4-4v4M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V4Zm0 1H4v3a4 4 0 0 0 4 4m9-7h3v3a4 4 0 0 1-4 4\"/></svg>我的战绩</a>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:\"Nunito Variable\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",-apple-system,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--yellow,#ffca28);color:#112b5f;border:2px solid #ffec9b;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#1762d8);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "视图标签",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "view-tab-active",
      "description": "海蓝白字明确标识当前视图。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\"><button class=\"ds-tab ds-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">标准视图</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" aria-pressed=\"false\">概率热图</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2,#e6efff)}.ds-tab{font-family:\"Nunito Variable\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",-apple-system,sans-serif;min-height:40px;padding:7px 14px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#405d88);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}.ds-tab.ds-active{background:var(--ocean,#1762d8);color:white;font-weight:600}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#1762d8);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "战绩状态",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "battle-status",
      "description": "非操作状态说明，与房间标题并列。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\">已结算</span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{font-family:\"Nunito Variable\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",-apple-system,sans-serif;display:inline-block;background:var(--yellow,#ffca28);color:#112b5f;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}"
    },
    {
      "name": "当前战绩容器",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "battle-card",
      "description": "蓝色描边、主题色面、大数值与辅助单位。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><h2>房间 1</h2><p>花费棋子</p><strong>28 <small>枚</small></strong></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:\"Nunito Variable\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",-apple-system,sans-serif;background:var(--surface,#fffdf3);color:var(--ink,#112b5f);border:2px solid var(--primary,#1762d8);border-radius:14px;padding:24px}.ds-card h2{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:850}.ds-card p{margin:22px 0 9px;color:var(--muted,#405d88);font-size:13px}.ds-card strong{color:var(--primary-ink,#17499b);font-size:38px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:900;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-card small{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted,#405d88)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "语义棋格",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "board-cell",
      "description": "未知、数字、宝石与推荐共用方格语法。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-grid\"><button class=\"ds-cell\" aria-label=\"A1 宝石概率 57%\">57%</button><button class=\"ds-cell ds-number\" aria-label=\"B1 数字 3\">3</button><button class=\"ds-cell ds-gem\" aria-label=\"C1 已发现宝石\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"m6 3-5 6 11 13L23 9l-5-6H6Zm-5 6h22M6 3l6 19 6-19\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-cell ds-best\" aria-label=\"D1 推荐，宝石概率 35%\">35%</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,52px);gap:5px}.ds-cell{font-family:\"Nunito Variable\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",-apple-system,sans-serif;aspect-ratio:1;min-width:0;min-height:0;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;background:var(--cell,#d9eaff);color:var(--ink,#112b5f);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 #112b5f10;cursor:pointer;outline-offset:-3px;transition:background .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s}.ds-cell:hover{border-color:var(--primary,#1762d8)}.ds-cell:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#1762d8)}.ds-number{background:var(--surface,#fffdf3);color:var(--primary-ink,#17499b);border-color:var(--line,#b4c9ed);font-size:22px}.ds-gem{background:var(--gem-soft,#ffdd63);color:var(--gem,#6b4b00)}.ds-best{background:var(--yellow,#ffca28);color:#112b5f;outline:2px solid var(--primary,#1762d8);outline-offset:1px;border-color:var(--primary,#1762d8)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "选中房间",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "room-navigation-active",
      "description": "固定海蓝承托当前房间，白字与浅金黄辅助数。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-room\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span><strong>房间 1</strong><small>8 × 8 · 进行中</small></span><b>5 / 20</b></button>",
      "css": ".ds-room{font-family:\"Nunito Variable\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",-apple-system,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:220px;min-height:72px;padding:12px 10px;border:1px solid var(--ocean,#1762d8);border-radius:10px;background:var(--ocean,#1762d8);color:white;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s}.ds-room strong{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-room small{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:#fff0a0}.ds-room b{margin-left:auto;color:#fff0a0;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-room:hover{background:var(--ocean,#1762d8)}.ds-room:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#1762d8);outline-offset:3px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "海蓝棋盘与金黄战绩册",
    "overview": "原创探索奖励册：海蓝承托操作框架，金黄承托宝石、核心动作和收获，冷浅蓝页面让密集棋盘保持清晰。深色主题沿用相同语义，切换为深海蓝底与明亮文字；顶栏和金黄动作保留身份色。\n\n清晰、可信、轻快的中文本地工具以事实和推测的视觉区分为基础。圆角、几何宝石标记、粗数字和少量内嵌深度形成游戏气质；棋盘与分析保持紧凑，战绩页用更大的数字表达数量与比例。视觉不依赖游戏截图或真实金属、纸张纹理。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "海蓝操作框架与金黄结果强调。",
      "Nunito 数字与平台中文字体，数值优先。",
      "全列自适应棋盘与完整八状态图例。",
      "浅深主题、键盘焦点、触摸与减少动画兼容。",
      "固定战绩图片与只读链接共享同一快照。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Pair Rule",
        "body": "每种棋盘颜色必须同时具有数字、文字、符号或边框状态；已录入事实、推测旗标、精确概率与识别待核对状态保持可辨。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Number First Rule",
        "body": "数量和比例使用清晰粗数字与等宽数字特性；单位退居辅助层，不以装饰文字抢占数字层级。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Inset Depth Rule",
        "body": "主要按钮与棋格使用轻内嵌深度；工作面靠描边和色面区分，浮层只使用柔和阴影。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保留全列棋盘，按实际容器宽度同时缩放格子、坐标轴、间距和数值。",
      "Do 在八状态图例、棋格和分析中保持同一语义，并明确事实与推测。",
      "Do 为独立操作保留至少 44px 的主要触摸目标；密集棋格通过状态编辑弹窗提供大按钮。",
      "Do 使用主题语义变量，并保留可见键盘焦点、原生弹窗与减少动画设置。",
      "Do 在导出战绩中保留四项数量／比例、统计依据与二维码；图片及链接保持同一固定快照。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 把棋盘放入内部横向滚动容器或隐藏窄屏列。",
      "Don't 只靠颜色表达宝石、推荐、矛盾或待核对状态。",
      "Don't 将推断和旗标包装成已发现宝石或已消耗棋子。",
      "Don't 引入游戏截图、参考图复制、真实金属或纸张纹理作为品牌材料。",
      "Don't 将棋格中遗留的字体图形作为新界面的图标规范；新图标沿用现有内联 SVG。"
    ]
  }
}
